 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Seven Times a Soldier"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "재입대만 7번째"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Seven enlistments. Infinite service. Zero discharge. \n\nKim Jae-hwan, a lowly private, has been trapped in a never-ending military time loop, forced to relive his conscription over and over again. No matter what he does, he always ends up back at square one — Private, Day 1. \n\nThe only clue to breaking the cycle? A mysterious line in his military diary: \"It was truly the perfect military life.\" \n\nNow, in his 7th round of enlistment, Jae-hwan is ready to do whatever it takes— follow every order, befriend every superior, survive every absurdity— to finally write those cursed words… and escape. \n\nBut in a place where logic is warped and sanity is optional, can one soldier truly find the perfect military life?"
  },
